    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well-maintained three-bedroom semi-detached residence is ideally located in the established residential development of Racecourse Heights, just a short distance from Tralee town centre. Internally, the property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it ideally suited to comfortable family living. To the rear, the house benefits from a private, secure garden, providing an ideal setting for outdoor relaxation and entertaining. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a comfortable living room and a generously sized kitchen. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, with two of the bedrooms benefiting from walk-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage and everyday convenience. The master bedroom further benefits from an ensuite, while a family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation. The property enjoys a highly convenient location, with Tralee town centre and a wide selection of amenities, including MTU North Campus and Kerry Technology Park, shops, restaurants and leisure facilities, close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.8m x 2.0m \r\nLino flooring, under stairs storage\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 3.6m \r\nCarpet flooring, open fire place \r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.9m x 3.8m \r\nLino flooring, fitted kitchen, ground and eye level units\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.0m x 1.7m \r\nLino flooring, fitted units\r\n\r\nWC - 1.7m x 1.4m \r\nLino flooring, WC, WHB\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.0m \r\nSolid timber flooring, walk in wardrobe\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 0.9m \r\nSolid timber flooring, shower, WC, WHB \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.3m x 3.6m \r\nSolid timber flooring, walk in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.6m x 2.4m \r\nSolid timber flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.5m x 1.6m \r\nSolid timber flooring, bath, WC, WHB\r\n\r\n"
      },
